    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Crafted by ancient Dhakaani daashor smiths from folded adamantine and inscribed with runes of <em>atchaas</em> (martial honor and solemn resolve), this suit of full plate functions as <em>+1 resilient adamantine full plate</em>. The wearer embodies the unyielding courage of the empire, gaining complete immunity to the frightened condition and a +2 circumstance bonus to saving throws against emotion and mental effects.</p>"
